# Ignore all virtual environments and Python cache files
**/.venv*
**/venv*
**/__pycache__
**/*.pyc
**/*.pyo
**/*.pyd

# Ignore node_modules everywhere
**/node_modules

# Ignore git metadata
**/.git

# Ignore large build artifacts not needed for execution
**/artifacts
**/cache
agent-kernel/
frontend/backend/

# Ignore documentation/markdown files
*.md
docs/
